    "claim": "In 0e899dd3 at 2x speed and 0 s shift, every run failed. In most runs the ego slowed and drifted left into a slow car in the next lane. In one run that car cut in ahead and the ego braked too gently, which is the only true cut-in failure in the study. The two slower speeds tried in this scene had no failures.",
